; Price inference first uses the reference posting's commodity when it
; remains in the group's balance, then falls back to the first commodity
; that entered that balance.  Zero amounts do not enter the balance.
;
; The first transaction bills ten hours after a two-hour correction.
; Hours are reduced to seconds, so the first posting's commodity is absent
; from the balance.  The correction cancels before the dollars arrive;
; dollars enter first and are priced in time, at 24s, on Income:Consulting.
; In the second and third transactions, balanced virtual budget lines
; belong to a separate group.  The real reference commodities, ZAR and
; SEK, remain in their balances and determine the direction directly,
; despite the intervening transfers and zero fees.  Both sort after their
; counterpart, so a fixed sorted order would incorrectly price AUD or NOK.
; Each transaction uses its own pair, avoiding prior price targets (#1130).
; 3314_inference_order.test exercises the fallback in bracketed groups.

2024/01/05 Billing after a correction
    Assets:Time               2h
    Expenses:Time            -2h
    Income:Consulting     $-1500
    Assets:Billable          10h

2024/01/06 Exchange after a transfer and a zero fee
    [Budget:Travel]          $100
    [Budget:Available]      $-100
    Assets:Wallet:ZAR        50 ZAR
    Assets:Bank:ZAR         -50 ZAR
    Expenses:Fees             0 AUD
    Assets:Bank:ZAR        -115 ZAR
    Assets:AUD              100 AUD

2024/01/07 Exchange with a fee posted between the transfer legs
    [Budget:Travel]          $100
    [Budget:Available]      $-100
    Assets:Wallet:SEK        50 SEK
    Expenses:Fees             0 NOK
    Assets:Bank:SEK         -50 SEK
    Assets:NOK              100 NOK
    Assets:Bank:SEK        -115 SEK

test pricedb
P 2024/01/05 00:00:00 $ 24s
P 2024/01/06 00:00:00 ZAR 0.869565 AUD
P 2024/01/07 00:00:00 SEK 0.869565 NOK
end test

test bal --lots --flat --no-total Assets Income
             100 AUD  Assets:AUD
-165 SEK {0.869565 NOK} [2024/01/07]  Assets:Bank:SEK
-165 ZAR {0.869565 AUD} [2024/01/06]  Assets:Bank:ZAR
              10.00h  Assets:Billable
             100 NOK  Assets:NOK
               2.00h  Assets:Time
50 SEK {0.869565 NOK} [2024/01/07]  Assets:Wallet:SEK
50 ZAR {0.869565 AUD} [2024/01/06]  Assets:Wallet:ZAR
$-1500 {24s} [2024/01/05]  Income:Consulting
end test
